# vim: ts=4 sw=4 expandtab
flush       source-code: flush it from memory and re-read all source-code files
lg          append current status/info to logs/dialogue_log.md, using the
            format already in use in that file.
cst         re-read and follow the coding standards:
            for_gemini/detailed_coding_guidelines
dtch        don't change any code now - until I tell you that you can.
flst        List all the files, context buffers, and workspace directories
            you are currently tracking or holding in context.
gitdf       git diff --no-ext-diff --staged 
svknwldg    Save our current architecture decisions, active bug status,
            and key findings into project memory to:
            ./work/current-detailed-status-<current-date>.md
